{"a":[14,14],"h":"<p>14.<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"207\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 206.7 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.4 16.4 16.4 25.4 25.4 37.4 44.3 60.0 60.0 70.4 70.4 82.4 98.3 98.3 107.3 114.7 130.4 130.4 139.4 139.4 147.7 154.4 162.7 162.7 170.3 177.0 183.7 183.7\" y=\"26.3 26.3 26.3 21.0 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"37.4 44.3 82.4 107.3 114.7 147.7 177.0 190.4\" y=\"26.3\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> Münafıklar, Mü'minlere: Biz sizinle beraber değil miydik? diye bağırışırlar - dünyada zahiren «<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"33\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 33.3 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 9.7 16.6 23.3\" y=\"26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> » deyip Mü'min göründüklerini söylemek isterler. Buna karşı Mü'minler<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"69\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 68.8 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 23.3 31.6 31.6 39.0 45.7\" y=\"26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"45.7 52.6\" y=\"26.3\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> diyecekler<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"229\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 229.3 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 16.6 25.6 25.6 49.6 49.6 56.3 56.3 63.0 78.7 78.7 87.7 87.7 94.6 94.6 101.3 108.0 123.7 123.7 132.7 132.7 144.7 144.7 151.6 151.6 163.6 163.6 171.0 188.3 199.6 199.6 206.3\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"37.6 37.6 63.0 101.3 108.0 144.7 171.0 206.3 213.0\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> evet.. ve lâkin sizler kendilerinizi fitneye soktunuz-ya'ni munafıklık ile mihnete düşürdünüz, ateşe doğru gittiniz, helâk ettiniz<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"92\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 92.0 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.4 16.4 25.4 25.4 32.3 32.3 46.4 46.4 53.3 60.7 67.4\" y=\"26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"46.4 53.3 60.7 67.4 75.7\" y=\"21.0 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> ve gözettiniz - Mü'minlere musıbet gelmesini beklediniz. Bunun da sebebi<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"85\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 85.3 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.4 16.4 25.4 25.4 32.3 32.3 39.0 45.7 45.7 54.0 60.7\" y=\"26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"39.0 60.7 69.0\" y=\"26.3\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> ve şübhe ettiniz işkillendiniz - inanamadınız, hakikaten Mü'minlerle beraber olmadınız<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"41\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 41.0 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.4\" y=\"26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"16.4 24.7\" y=\"26.3\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> ve - bunun sebebi<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"136\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 136.3 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.4 16.4 16.4 27.7 27.7 34.4 41.2 48.0 52.4 60.0 75.7 75.7 84.7 84.7 96.7 96.7 103.4 103.4 111.0\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"41.2 48.0 103.4 111.0 120.0\" y=\"25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> ümniyyeleriniz sizi aldattı - Boş temenniyat ve hulyalarla kuruntularınıza mağrur oldunuz, Münafıklıkla o boş kuruntulara ireceğinizi, islâmın muvaffak olamıyacağını zannettiniz<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"164\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 164.0 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 16.6 23.3 23.3 23.3 30.0 37.6 53.3 53.3 60.7 60.7 67.6 83.3 90.0 90.0 96.7 117.7 129.0 129.0 129.0 135.7\" y=\"25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"67.6 83.3 96.7 135.7 147.7\" y=\"25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> tâ Allahın emri, ya'ni ölüm gelinciye kadar mağrurlandınız<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"41\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 41.0 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.4\" y=\"26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"16.4 24.7\" y=\"26.3\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> ve - bunun da sebebi<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"167\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 167.0 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 16.6 24.7 33.0 33.0 40.6 47.3 47.3 54.7 70.6 70.6 77.3 77.3 77.3 84.0 91.6 98.3 98.3 114.0 114.0 123.0 123.0 134.3 134.3 141.7\" y=\"25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 26.3 25.4 25.4 20.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 26.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"40.6 134.3 141.7 150.7\" y=\"25.4 20.3 25.4 25.4\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> o aldatıcı mağrur, ya'ni Şeytan sizi Allaha güvendirdi - adam sende günahın zararı yoktur Allah gafur rahîmdir afveder diye keyfleriniz arkasından koşturdu. </p>"}